@startuml
title Process states and transitions
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EAF6F0
  BorderColor #2E8B67
  ArrowColor #2E8B67
}
skinparam arrow {
  Color #2E8B67
}
state New
state Ready
state Running
state Waiting
state Zombie

[*] --> New : fork()
New --> Ready : created and initialised\n(ready to be scheduled)
Ready --> Running : elected by\nthe scheduler
Running --> Ready : preempted\n(time slice used up)
Running --> Waiting : suspended\n(I/O request, wait on a resource)
Waiting --> Ready : woken up\n(I/O done, resource available)
Running --> Zombie : terminated\n(exit())
Zombie --> [*] : reaped by\nwaitpid()
@enduml
